    "releaseDate": null,
    "description": "Collect, parse, normalise and visualise Windows Defender Firewall activity from your Windows workstations and servers: the connection log (pfirewall.log), the firewall configuration and policy change events, the Windows Filtering Platform audit events that attribute a connection to the binary that opened it, and - with the companion TA-windows-firewall-posture - the current configuration state of every host. Ships hardened data inputs, a version-tolerant field extraction, CIM compliant knowledge objects for the Network Traffic and Change data models, an accelerable data model, eight Dashboard Studio views (Overview, Traffic Explorer, Traffic Investigator, Host 360, Peer Pivot, Process Attribution, Firewall Changes, Threat Hunting, Firewall Posture) and twenty-four ready-to-use detections and reports.",
    "classification": {
      "categories": [
        "IT Operations",
        "Security, Fraud & Compliance"
      ],
      "developmentStatus": "Production/Stable",
      "intendedAudience": "IT Professionals"
    },
